WEBVTT

00:00:07.920 --> 00:00:10.610
The winner, Akira Shiroyanagi!

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.360
<i>I made it through that one.</i>

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:20.320
<i>But there's a lot about this 
ability I still need to test.</i>

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:23.650
<i>The game's just getting started.</i>

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.750
That's the sophist I know.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.150
It all went just as he planned it.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.930
Isn't that right, Akira?

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:37.990
After all, your ability is...

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:43.560
<b>Your</b>

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:48.560
<b><<Sophist>>

00:00:44.220 --> 00:00:47.460
Whatever the other person 
thinks your ability is.

00:00:49.310 --> 00:00:54.860
In order to use an ability, you had 
to make your opponent picture it.

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:59.570
<i>But if I just describe 
an ability off the bat,</i>

00:00:59.570 --> 00:01:01.090
<i>an opponent is unlikely 
to really believe me.</i>

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:06.290
So he had to create circumstances where 
the opponent would ask about it.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:08.810
<i>If I leave any room for doubt, I'm finished.</i>

00:01:08.810 --> 00:01:11.500
<i>I have only one chance to convince him.</i>

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:15.250
He convinced him it might 
be a dangerous ability.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:17.140
<i>And the moment he attacked...</i>

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:18.540
...he spoke the words.

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:19.730
<i>With no time to wonder...</i>

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.010
...the image entered his mind.

00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:21.780
<i>To concisely...</i>

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:22.730
...effortlessly...

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:23.730
<i>...and precisely...</i>

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:26.650
...put an image into someone's mind!

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:26.650
<i>put an image into someone's mind!</i>

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:28.520
My ability...

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:29.530
Sophist.

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.060
The "turn your hand into a cannon" ability!

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:35.810
<i>The "whatever the other person thinks 
your ability is" ability.</i>

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:27.430
<b>Time Until</b>

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:29.930
<b>Episode 2  "Demon God"</b>

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.220
I have to get home.

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.020
Don't you have work today, Yuuri?

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:37.190
No shifts today.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:39.030
Wanna hang out, then?

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.150
No money.

00:03:40.150 --> 00:03:43.780
Huh? You're working so hard you're 
even skipping school sometimes!

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:44.910
I'm saving up.

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:46.780
Look! A puppy!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:49.240
So cute!

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.580
And so friendly!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.910
Come pet it with us, Yuuri!

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.100
Cheer up, Yuuri!

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:08.930
It just happened to bark, is all.

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.310
Just random chance!

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:13.600
Don't talk to me about "it just 
happened" and "random chance."

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:17.650
<i>I hate "random chance."</i>

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.020
<i>Back then, too...</i>

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:23.570
<i>Watching everyone else walk 
by like they didn't see it...</i>

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:24.990
<i>It just really pissed me off.</i>

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:29.950
<i>I didn't give it a second thought.</i>

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.620
<i>But he turned out to be a stalker perv,</i>

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:38.130
<i>and he started following me everywhere...</i>

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.170
We meet again, Yuuri!

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.090
<i>I've missed you, Yuuri!</i>

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:45.180
<i>Yuuri!</i>

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.340
<i>Yuuri!</i>

00:04:46.340 --> 00:04:47.760
<i>Yuuri!</i>

00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:51.720
<i>It's enough to steal a person's 
ability to trust anyone.</i>

00:04:55.520 --> 00:04:56.730
I'm back.

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:57.770
Yuuri!

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.480
There's someone I want you to meet.

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.530
Is this the famous daughter?

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.660
Isn't he wonderful?

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.570
We just happened to meet at a bar.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.530
It felt like destiny, though.

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.240
<i>Not again.</i>

00:05:10.780 --> 00:05:14.580
I never see women as hot as her there.

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:17.040
<i>The men mom "just happens" to bring 
home from bars are all the same.</i>

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:18.500
<i>I despise them.</i>

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:21.880
How can you have such a 
grown-up daughter, Minako?

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:24.260
You've got to be way too young.

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:25.720
Oh, you sweet-talker!

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:28.180
Oh, Yuuri?

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.600
He's got a kid, too.

00:05:30.600 --> 00:05:32.640
She's a girl, like you.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.140
You'll look after her now 
and again, won't you?

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:37.390
Hey, what a great idea!

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:39.270
<i>Because her boyfriend 
"just happened" to have a daughter,</i>

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.190
<i>they want me to take care of her?</i>

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.110
<i>Give me a break.</i>

00:05:44.440 --> 00:05:46.110
<i>I'm so sick of it.</i>

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.570
<i>That day, too...</i>

00:05:50.620 --> 00:05:52.910
<b>Find your NEW LIFE here!!
Leave your housing needs to Satou Real Estate!</b>

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:56.750
Him?!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:01.040
<i>If I hadn't "just happened" to see 
him on that building's roof...</i>

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.750
Hey! What's wrong with you?!

00:06:05.960 --> 00:06:07.340
Incredible...

00:06:07.340 --> 00:06:10.430
How did you know I was here?

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:15.390
We really are connected by 
an invisible thread, Yuuri!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:20.060
Stop being stupid and get over 
here, you stalker creep!

00:06:20.060 --> 00:06:21.940
I don't give a crap if you kill yourself,

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.860
but have the decency to do it 
somewhere I won't have to care!

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.690
I won't go...

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:29.320
If you won't return my feelings,
 I'd rather die!

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.780
Oh, for the love of...

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:32.370
Why is this happening?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.000
Come on! Just take my hand!

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:40.000
I've got better things 
to be doing, you know!

00:06:40.580 --> 00:06:42.460
I knew it...

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.050
You can't really abandon me!

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:50.800
It's like that first time we just 
happened to meet, and you saved me.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.760
Give me a break, you stupid little—

00:07:00.690 --> 00:07:01.650
No way.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:03.650
This can't be—

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:12.280
<b>Time Until</b>

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.370
<i>I was half-sure I'd wake up in my old room,</i>

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:19.000
<i>to realize that disgusting 
lovers' suicide,</i>

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:21.420
<i>and the bizarre woman with the arm cannon,</i>

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.080
<i>were all part of some 
kind of weird dream.</i>

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.250
<i>Then I'd just go about my day, and...</i>

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.800
<i>I have to get home. Home...</i>

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:35.010
<i>There's not even a doorknob?!</i>

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:37.350
<i>I'm a total freaking prisoner!</i>

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.390
<i>Why is this happening to me?</i>

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:42.810
We chose you...

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:44.100
entirely at random.

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.270
"Just happened" to choose me, huh?

00:07:47.270 --> 00:07:48.280
How funny.

00:07:49.110 --> 00:07:52.280
Actually, it's not funny at all!

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:54.780
Give me a break!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:57.990
You can't lock me up based on random chance!

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:00.750
Let me out! Let me out!

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:03.620
Let me go home!

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:10.130
I really have to... get home.

00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:14.680
Isn't she interesting?

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:16.220
A very strong candidate!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:17.850
What's her ability?

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:21.230
Well, her name is Yuuri Amagake.

00:08:21.230 --> 00:08:22.180
Her ability is...

00:08:24.440 --> 00:08:27.190
This ability with that personality?

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:32.610
This might be <i>quite</i> interesting indeed.

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:38.530
<i>That's right... I've got one of 
those ability things too, right?</i>

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.420
What in the world?

00:08:47.420 --> 00:08:48.750
What does that mean?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.260
How am I supposed to test it?

00:09:06.190 --> 00:09:08.190
No freaking way.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:09.730
Wow...

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:12.610
I wonder...

00:09:13.610 --> 00:09:15.740
How very predictable!

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.780
Oh, come on!

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:22.910
This stupid ability is totally useless!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:30.130
I hope she didn't think we'd give her 
an ability that would let her escape.

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.760
<i>This is always how it is for me.</i>

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.760
<i>Nothing ever goes my way.</i>

00:09:38.970 --> 00:09:40.140
I'm back!

00:09:42.430 --> 00:09:46.770
<i>My secret stash is almost to 
its goal, one million yen.</i>

00:09:47.310 --> 00:09:51.480
<i>Almost enough to ditch this place 
and make a life on my own.</i>

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:53.980
Who's there?

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:00.160
Riria...

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:04.120
<i>Oh, Mom's new boyfriend's kid.</i>

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:08.790
Um... they told me to stay here with you.

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:09.830
Oh, yeah?

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:11.340
When'd they go out?

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:13.920
Dunno. This morning.

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.260
This morning?

00:10:15.260 --> 00:10:17.050
What did you have for breakfast?

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:31.770
Hey, c'mon. Take it easy there!

00:10:41.650 --> 00:10:43.950
Th-Thank you very much.

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.290
You've got good manners 
for such a little kid.

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:48.960
And you're a really good cook.

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:49.830
You think so?

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:52.500
I've been cooking since 
I was little and all.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:56.590
I dunno when the old m—
when your dad will be back,

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.010
so let's get you a bath.

00:11:04.510 --> 00:11:05.720
Want to go in together?

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:12.650
<i>I ended up looking after her after all.</i>

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:14.480
<i>What's wrong with me?</i>

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:17.280
<i>Well, they'll break up soon enough.</i>

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.690
<i>I can tolerate it until then.</i>

00:11:38.130 --> 00:11:40.300
I'm... sorry.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.230
<i>What in the world...</i>

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:55.110
<i>Why does this always happen?</i>

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.230
Mama! Mama!

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.450
Don't cry!

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.160
You still have me!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:06.530
Of course I do, Yuuri.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:08.080
I have you.

00:12:10.120 --> 00:12:11.870
And because I had you...

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:15.920
Because I <i>just happened</i> to 
have you with that man...

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.960
My entire life was ruined!

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:27.140
<i>The one-on-one pairings are decided.</i>

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:31.100
<i>For so long, I wanted nothing more 
than to escape that house.</i>

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.980
<i>But now...</i>

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:59.380
It was Yuuri, wasn't it?

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:05.800
At first, I cursed my fate, thinking 
I'd been cast into hell.

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:09.760
But you've given me reason to hope.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:16.600
I can smell you from here.

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.980
That smell tells me...

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:21.440
You're a virgin, aren't you, Yuuri?

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:24.570
Wh-Who the hell is this guy?

00:13:24.950 --> 00:13:26.570
Am I right?

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:28.320
I almost didn't believe it,

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:32.160
but they really have given me 
the most wonderful ability.

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:39.130
<b><<Perfumer>>

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:36.460
I just love how teenage girls smell.

00:13:36.460 --> 00:13:39.130
I always got a noseful when 
I was paying for escorts.

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:41.090
Well, how'd I do?

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.800
Was my guess right? Or wrong?

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:47.550
Shut the hell up, you old perv!

00:13:47.550 --> 00:13:51.310
One step closer, and I'll 
beat the shit out of you!

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:54.020
Oh, I'm counting on it!

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:59.230
I can't get off without a 
little show of resistance first!

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:01.360
I told you to stay the hell back!

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:14.580
What a blessing.

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:21.170
You've got amazing balance 
and reflexes, Yuuri.

00:14:21.170 --> 00:14:23.460
Surprising, given all that 
weight you've got <i>up top</i>.

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:27.050
I love it. Totally my fetish.

00:14:27.680 --> 00:14:29.680
I'm really excited now.

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.180
Same here.

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:32.850
<b>Blustering</b>

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.600
<b>Anxious</b>

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:34.010
Knowing you're the kind of perv 
who preys on little girls

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:34.350
<b>Loathing</b>

00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.890
<b>Shaken</b>

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.890
means I can beat the shit out
of you with a clean conscience.

00:14:34.510 --> 00:14:35.890
<b>Gross</b>

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:39.400
Bluster is a lovely shade on you.

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.850
<b>Fear</b>

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:40.850
<b>Disgust</b>

00:14:38.060 --> 00:14:40.850
<b>Blustering</b>

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:40.850
<b>Gross</b>

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.200
Wh-What the hell are you doing?!

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:50.160
There are no laws here.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:53.910
I can dress however I want!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:57.620
This guy is a total freaking degenerate...

00:14:54.030 --> 00:14:57.120
<b>Dismayed</b>

00:14:55.950 --> 00:14:57.540
<b>Shaken</b>

00:14:56.370 --> 00:14:57.870
<b>Confused</b>

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:03.000
Gross, gross, gross, gross, gross!

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:08.920
Gotcha now, dearie!

00:15:09.800 --> 00:15:12.720
Struggling won't save you.

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:17.640
What a lovely smell.

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:20.810
You're delicious in your terror as well.

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:23.650
Tell me more about yourself.

00:15:23.650 --> 00:15:25.940
Let me take control!

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:27.780
Let me... go...

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.240
<b>Pain</b>

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:28.240
<b>Disgust</b>

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:33.120
Holding you like this really 
takes me back... to that day.

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:37.700
You do this kind of thing a lot, mister?

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:39.410
I guess so.

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.750
It's kind of rejuvenating, you know?

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:44.630
Did I rejuvenate you, too?

00:15:43.420 --> 00:15:44.630
<b>Satou Trading Co.</b>

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:46.500
Oh, absolutely.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.920
This is a pretty big and 
famous company, huh?

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.470
So you're a big wheel there, huh?

00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:57.850
Oh... hardly.

00:16:00.310 --> 00:16:01.850
Two hundred thousand yen, please.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:05.310
That's not exactly what we agreed on...

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.820
I'm sure you can afford it.

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:09.280
If you don't have it on you,

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:12.030
I can come by your office 
to pick it up later.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.910
<i>She thinks she can threaten me?</i>

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:17.700
<i>The little brat is threatening <i>me</i>?!</i>

00:16:17.910 --> 00:16:19.410
<i>Don't be absurd!</i>

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.670
<i>I'm the one in control here!</i>

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:40.100
The trembling wouldn't stop.

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:45.400
The ecstasy of that first time...

00:16:45.400 --> 00:16:48.400
I've been addicted to it ever since.

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:50.570
I started working out

00:16:50.570 --> 00:16:54.490
so I could "take control" of all 
the teenage girls I paid for.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:58.330
When they brought me here, I worried 
I might not get to do it anymore.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:03.830
But my first battle just 
happened to be a teenage girl!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:07.420
What a marvelous stroke of random chance!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:10.960
We chose you...

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:11.920
entirely at random.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.670
It just happened to bark is all.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:15.130
Just random chance!

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:19.850
Like that first time we just happened 
to meet, and you saved me.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.060
We just happened to meet at a bar.

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:27.900
Because I <i>just happened</i> to 
have you with that man...

00:17:27.900 --> 00:17:30.360
My entire life was ruined!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.530
<i>Riria...</i>

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:39.280
Don't talk to me... about random chance!

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.870
All of you people...

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:44.790
How can you be so content

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:48.670
with harming those weaker than you?

00:17:48.670 --> 00:17:50.840
What... What the...

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:54.010
If you won't sympathize 
with our pain, then...

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:56.090
I'll force it on you!

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:02.770
What in the world?

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:08.940
<b>Rage</b>

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:08.940
<b>Hatred</b>

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:08.940
<b>Loathing</b>

00:18:03.220 --> 00:18:04.810
Y-You're supposed to fear me!

00:18:05.140 --> 00:18:09.650
I'm supposed to be the one in control!

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:14.570
Sh-She disappeared...

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:19.410
Die, you stupid piece of shit!

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:31.670
"Random chance"... and stupid assholes.

00:18:32.090 --> 00:18:35.960
I'm so sick of them all!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:39.680
<b>Demon God

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:38.180
Ms. Yuuri Amagake.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:43.430
Your ability is "the ability to 
quintuple your physical abilities."

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.430
<b>Demon God

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:48.980
I'll bust my way through 
every act of random chance!

00:18:49.810 --> 00:18:52.190
The winner, Yuuri Amagake!

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.320
<i>How could she move like that?</i>

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.280
<i>That ability...</i>

00:18:58.280 --> 00:19:01.620
<i>It should be hard for her to 
even walk with it at first.</i>

00:19:02.410 --> 00:19:05.790
<i>The situational stress made 
her unleash it instinctively.</i>

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:08.910
<i>Miss Mion was right.</i>

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:12.920
<i>A straightforward disposition and an 
ability that relies on instinct...</i>

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.670
<i>Yuuri Amagake...</i>

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:17.420
<i>Could she be a prodigy?</i>

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:18.920
Riria...

00:19:22.390 --> 00:19:24.300
I'll get home.

00:19:24.300 --> 00:19:26.600
I'll get home to you, Riria.

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.520
And no one's going to stop me!

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:42.240
<i>"I'll use this ability to crush you all."</i>

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.580
<i>I keep thinking that,</i>

00:19:46.410 --> 00:19:48.790
<i>but they don't seem to react at all,</i>

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:52.040
<i>which suggests their organization 
can't read my mind.</i>

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:58.420
<i>It's also possible that they can, 
and they're leaving me at large anyway.</i>

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:02.050
<i>But if they're trying to size me up,</i>

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:04.470
<i>I'll be happy to show them 
what I'm capable of.</i>

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:09.100
<i>That ability really is amazing.</i>

00:20:09.810 --> 00:20:11.890
<i>It can track what another person is thinking,</i>

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:13.400
<i>and make that reality.</i>

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.860
<i>I don't feel particularly 
tired out by it, either.</i>

00:20:17.320 --> 00:20:19.320
<i>Where does the power for it come from?</i>

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:21.780
Where do you think?

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:27.200
From lifespan, of course!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:30.910
The power source is someone's life.

00:20:31.290 --> 00:20:33.580
So every time you use an ability,

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.130
someone on the other side of Earth dies!

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.630
Just kidding!

00:20:45.760 --> 00:20:46.930
It's time.

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.850
<i>They called that the first program.</i>

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.940
<i>Which means it won't all be one-on-one.</i>

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:59.480
<i>What's the next program, then?</i>

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:02.240
Go inside.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:22.880
You?

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:27.220
<i>I will now explain the second program!</i>

00:21:27.680 --> 00:21:29.260
<i>Five-on-five team battles!</i>

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:31.410
<i>The program will commence in two hours!</i>

00:21:31.950 --> 00:21:33.210
Team battles?

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:39.940
<b>Demon God

00:23:10.200 --> 00:23:12.530
<b>Mion and Yang's 
\h\h\hNext Episode Preview</b>

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:12.540
Mion and Yang's Next Episode Preview!

00:23:12.540 --> 00:23:14.440
Did you enjoy our second episode?

00:23:14.440 --> 00:23:16.320
We'll have lots of battles next episode, too!

00:23:16.320 --> 00:23:18.900
Yes! And lots of new abilities on display!

00:23:18.900 --> 00:23:19.770
I can't wait!

00:23:19.770 --> 00:23:23.480
And Ojamajo Mion's apprentice training 
continues with a grand adventure!

00:23:23.480 --> 00:23:24.530
No adventure!

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:25.600
Are you still on that?

00:23:25.600 --> 00:23:28.770
Then she'll use the Cat Breathing training 
she's learned to destroy the hated Yang!

00:23:28.770 --> 00:23:30.460
You will not! Stop it!

00:23:30.460 --> 00:23:31.700
And I thought you were the witch!

00:23:31.700 --> 00:23:33.660
Well, I didn't have much 
screen time this episode!

00:23:33.660 --> 00:23:35.260
I need a little spotlight!

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:37.730
We'll see you for episode 3!

00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:39.480
Cat Breathing!
